  "description": "A vibrant sci-fi platform adventure game for the Nintendo Switch™, where you help Maxwell the dog explore unfamiliar worlds, make strange new friends and contend with mysterious forces - by jumping, shooting, slicing, shrinking, warping and drilling.\n\nMaxwell’s homeworld is nearing collapse. In a last ditch-effort to find help, he hyperjumps where no dog has gone before. Stranded, he finds himself on the edge of a hostile system - if there’s any hope of return and rescue he’ll need every friend (and every weapon) he can find.\n\nForced to confront this celestial expanse head on, Maxwell stays strong - determined to keep his head up and lend a helping hand to everyone he meets on his journey. Like all underdogs, the odds are stacked against him, but you can’t keep a good dog down.\n\nKey Features\n· Explore jam-packed levels with multiple routes\n· Make 50+ friends & collect their friendship cards\n· Upgrade your blaster with special abilities\n· Find hidden areas and take on a variety of boss battles\n· Local couch co-op multiplayer mode\n· Bonus prequel content: Chapter Zero",
